<Slide>
  <Box style={{
    width: '100%',
    height: '100%',
    backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: 50,
    display: 'flex',
    flexDirection: 'column',
  }}>
    <Text style={{
      fontSize: 14,
      color: '#0EA5E9',
      letterSpacing: 2,
      marginBottom: 8,
    }}>
      03 架构
    </Text>
    <Text style={{
      fontSize: 36,
      fontWeight: 'bold',
      color: '#1F3A8A',
      marginBottom: 16,
    }}>
      一层很薄的"智能总闸"
    </Text>

    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      display: 'flex',
      flexDirection: 'row',
      gap: 24,
      marginTop: 12,
    }}>
      <Box style={{
        flex: 1.4,
        backgroundColor: '#F8FAFC',
        borderRadius: 12,
        padding: 16,
        display: 'flex',
        alignItems: 'center',
        justifyContent: 'center',
      }}>
        <Image
          src="assets/llm-api-gateway-architecture.png"
          style={{ width: '100%', objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8 }}
        />
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{
          fontSize: 16,
          color: '#475569',
          lineHeight: 1.6,
        }}>
          调用方拿到的就是一个<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A8A' }}>标准 OpenAI 格式的接口</span>，体验和直接调官方 API 没区别。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{
          backgroundColor: '#0F172A',
          padding: 18,
          borderRadius: 8,
        }}>
          <Text style={{
            fontSize: 11,
            color: '#94A3B8',
            fontFamily: 'monospace',
            marginBottom: 8,
          }}>
            $ curl
          </Text>
          <Text style={{
            fontSize: 12,
            color: '#E2E8F0',
            fontFamily: 'monospace',
            lineHeight: 1.6,
          }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#0EA5E9' }}>curl</span> http://gateway.内网:9000/v1/chat/completions \{"\n"}
            {"  "}-H <span style={{ color: '#10B981' }}>"Authorization: Bearer sk-张三"</span> \{"\n"}
            {"  "}-d <span style={{ color: '#10B981' }}>'{"{"}</span>
            {"\n  "}<span style={{ color: '#10B981' }}>  "model": "deepseek-chat",</span>{"\n"}
            {"  "}<span style={{ color: '#10B981' }}>  "messages": [...]</span>
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{
          fontSize: 13,
          color: '#64748B',
          lineHeight: 1.5,
        }}>
          改个 base_url 就接上。所有"秩序"都发生在网关这一层。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
